{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Recommend mortgage packages"},"description":"Rank live Singapore mortgage packages for one borrower and loan. Returns `recommended` (up to 3 picks with `reasoning`), `lowestRateIds` (cheapest eligible first), `isPersonalised` and `packages` (full details by id).\n\nRequired: `dealKind` (PURCHASE | REFINANCE), `propertyType` (HDB | PRIVATE | COMMERCIAL), `propertyStatus`, `loanAmount` (SGD); for REFINANCE also `currentBankId` from `list_banks`. Ask for missing facts; do not guess. Valid statuses: HDB: COMPLETED or BTO; PRIVATE: COMPLETED or BUC; COMMERCIAL: OWNEROCCUPIED, INVESTMENT or PERSONAL.\n\nOptional: `ratesType` (FIXED | FLOATING), `userContext` (free-text priorities).\n\nCall again with the full input set whenever anything changes. Not for what-if rates (use `calculate_mortgage_repayment`). Read-only: nothing is saved.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"candidateLimit":{"default":60,"description":"How many candidate packages the ranker weighs for each of its slots (floating, 2-year fixed, longest fixed); values above 8 have no further effect. Leave unset unless deliberately narrowing the choice.","maximum":60,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"currentBankId":{"description":"The borrower's current lender, as the bank `id` returned by `list_banks`. Needed for REFINANCE deals, where that bank's packages are left out; ignored for PURCHASE.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"dealKind":{"description":"PURCHASE (new loan) or REFINANCE (switching lender).","enum":["PURCHASE","REFINANCE"],"type":"string"},"fixedDurationYrs":{"anyOf":[